      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "THE LAST VIDEO STORE"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "A proposal for a documentary feature, prepared for financiers who have"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "never rewound anything."
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "THE OPPORTUNITY"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "There were once nine thousand video rental stores in this country. There"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "are now fewer than a dozen. Each one that closes takes with it a set of"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "recommendations that existed nowhere else, held by a person who never"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "wrote any of it down."
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "We propose to film the last year of one of them."
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "AUDIENCE"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "The film is for the generation that grew up inside these rooms and for"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "the one that has only ever been handed an algorithm. It argues, gently,"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "that the difference between the two is a person."
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "BUDGET"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "A crew of four, ninety shooting days, and the patience to wait for a"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "Tuesday when nothing happens. The full schedule follows overleaf, along"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "with the letters of access we have already secured."
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "This page exists to be rejected by the screenplay guard, and its prose"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "is padded to make sure the extractor sees a healthy text layer while the"
        },
        {
          "op": "showText",
          "text": "parser finds nothing screenplay-shaped in it."
        }
      ],
